DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260729
SUMMARY:🍽 Italian Sausage Pasta
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 35 min\n\nSides: garlic bread / frozen broccoli\n\nBrown sausage with bell peppers and onions\, add sauce. Works great with any pasta shape. Switched to whole wheat pasta for fiber — sauce masks the flavor/color change.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 lb – Marketside Mild Ground Italian Sausage\, 1 lb\n• 1 jar – Prego Creamy Tomato Pasta Sauce OR RAGU\, 24 oz\n• 1 box – Great Value Whole Wheat Penne\, 16 oz\n• 2 each – Fresh Green Bell Peppers\n• 0.5 each – Fresh Sweet Onion\n• 1 pkg – Amodeo's Five Cheese Breadsticks (frozen)
END:VEVENT
