DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 25 min\n\nSides: Knorr noodles / sweet corn\n\nManwich + ground beef. Done in 20 minutes. Serve with Del Monte corn. Black beans pureed into the sauce for hidden fiber — kids won't notice.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 lb – 73% Lean / 27% Fat Ground Beef\, 1 lb\n• 1 can – Manwich Original Sloppy Joe Sauce\, 15 oz\n• 1 pkg – Ball Park White Hot Dog Buns OR Burger Buns\, 8 ct\n• 0.5 pack – Del Monte Golden Sweet Whole Kernel Corn\, 15.25 oz (4-pack)\n• 1 can – Great Value Black Beans\, 15 oz
