UID:2026-09-02-meal@plan.py
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260903
SUMMARY:🍽 Carnitas Tacos
DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 240 min\n\nSides: refried beans / sweet corn\n\nMoved here from Aug 29 (Saturday) — that night's dinner became an ad hoc grilled cheese + tomato soup audible instead. Since Carnitas Tacos is itself a taco-night meal\, it now fills the Wed Sep 2 Taco Wednesday slot directly rather than double-booking. Displaced Chicken Quesadillas (originally slotted here) rolled forward to Sep 15. Pork shoulder needs to be on hand/thawed by Wednesday morning — reconfirm purchase timing since this was originally planned as a Saturday pickup.\n\nSlow cook pork shoulder all day. Broil briefly for crispy edges.\n\nIngredients:\n• 3 lb – Pork Shoulder\n• 1 pkg – Old El Paso Stand 'N Stuff Bold Nacho Cheese Taco Shells\n• 1 can – Rosarita Traditional Refried Beans\n• 1 packet – McCormick Chili Seasoning Mix\n• 2 each – Fresh Limes\n• 0.5 bag – Fresh Green Cilantro\n• 0.25 bag – Fresh Red Onions\n• 1 bag – Great Value Colby Jack Shredded Cheese
END:VEVENT
