DESCRIPTION:Cook time: 30 min\n\nRolled forward from Aug 31 in the prior calendar\, itself originally rolled forward from skipped Aug 14.\n\nIngredients:\n• 1 pkg – Hillshire Farm Polska Kielbasa\n• 1 box – Dirty Rice (mix)\n• 1 each – Fresh Green Bell Peppers
END:VEVENT
